# Cloudflare Web Analytics site token, from the Web Analytics dashboard for
# motedesktop.com. The site is prerendered, so this is read at build time and
# baked into the HTML — set it in the Cloudflare Pages build environment.
#
# Leave it unset and no analytics script is served at all, which is what a
# local `bun dev` and any fork should do.
VITE_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
